{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "2SA",
 "chapter": 1,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.2",
   "range": "2SA.1.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fb291c52",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.2#p1-fb291c52",
     "text": "Seeming to lament the overthrow of the people of Israel.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "his clothes rent"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.6",
   "range": "2SA.1.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "af52075f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.6#p1-af52075f",
     "text": "As I fled the chase.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "As I happened by chance upon"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.8",
   "range": "2SA.1.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2bfa848c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.8#p1-2bfa848c",
     "text": "He was an Amalekite born, but renounced his country and joined with the Israelites.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "Amalekite"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.9",
   "range": "2SA.1.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7375c01a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.9#p1-7375c01a",
     "text": "I am sorry, because I am yet alive.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "life is yet whole in me"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.13",
   "range": "2SA.1.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "42b5a3c7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.13#p1-42b5a3c7",
     "text": "After the lamentation, he examined him again.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "And David said unto the young"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.16",
   "range": "2SA.1.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "77f60934",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.16#p1-77f60934",
     "text": "You are justly punished for your fault.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "Thy blood be upon thy head"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.18",
   "range": "2SA.1.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ad1fc7f6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.18#p1-ad1fc7f6",
     "text": "That they might be able to match their enemies the Philistines in that art.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "the use of the bow"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.19",
   "range": "2SA.1.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5f6944ba",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.19#p1-5f6944ba",
     "text": "Meaning Saul.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "slain upon thy high places"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.21",
   "range": "2SA.1.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1c15dd67",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.21#p1-1c15dd67",
     "text": "Let their fertile fields be barren, and bring forth no fruit to offer to the Lord.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "fields of offerings"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.23",
   "range": "2SA.1.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1e965b43",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.23#p1-1e965b43",
     "text": "They died both together in Gilboa.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "divided"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.24",
   "range": "2SA.1.24",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "734a4477",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.24#p1-734a4477",
     "text": "As rich garments and costly jewels.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "with other delights"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.1.26",
   "range": "2SA.1.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "968525bf",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.1.26#p1-968525bf",
     "text": "Either toward their husbands or their children.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "women"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
